{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29226","headline":"维舟秦淮过温州李给事宅 · 许浑","name":"维舟秦淮过温州李给事宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"给事爲郎日，青溪醉隐衔。\n冰池通极浦，雪迳遶高岩。\n珠玉砂同弃，松筠草共芟。\n帝图忧一失，臣节耻三缄。\n代有王陵戆，时无靳尚谗。\n定应标直笔，宁爲发空函。\n雾黑连云栈，风狂截海帆。\n石梯迎雨润，沙井待潮咸。\n蜡屐青筇杖，蓝舆白罽衫。\n应劳北归梦，山路正巉巉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29226.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29226","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}